1
00:00:10,060 --> 00:00:13,077
Nineteen eighty-six, I painted Ocean Drive in gold

2
00:00:13,127 --> 00:00:16,081
First voice in the franchise — watch a real mob boss unfold

3
00:00:16,102 --> 00:00:18,441
Did fifteen up in Harwood, never snitched a single name

4
00:00:18,485 --> 00:00:20,601
Took Diaz's whole mansion and I owned the city's game

5
00:00:20,651 --> 00:00:23,107
Fled to Liberty City when your brother took the fall

6
00:00:23,157 --> 00:00:25,739
Came home on a kid's bike while Tenpenny owned you all

7
00:00:25,789 --> 00:00:28,268
Big Smoke sold your family out for drive-thru number nines

8
00:00:28,308 --> 00:00:30,955
"All you had to do was follow that damn train" down the lines

9
00:00:33,127 --> 00:00:35,772
"Here we go again" — man, you talkin' 'bout a train?

10
00:00:35,818 --> 00:00:38,333
Step three feet in the ocean and you drown inside the rain

11
00:00:38,380 --> 00:00:40,757
King of Vice Beach? Homie, you sink just like a stone

12
00:00:40,807 --> 00:00:43,377
I swim, skydive, and jetpack through three cities of my own

13
00:00:43,427 --> 00:00:45,885
Two flat tourist islands — that's the tiny map you ran

14
00:00:45,935 --> 00:00:48,464
Crying at toy choppers up in "Demolition Man"

15
00:00:48,498 --> 00:00:50,827
Twenty-seven million copies — check the PlayStation throne

16
00:00:50,855 --> 00:00:53,503
While you borrowed Tony Montana's suit, mansion, and tone

17
00:01:03,978 --> 00:01:06,137
"Borrowed Tony's mansion"? Kid, I made the eighties mine

18
00:01:06,187 --> 00:01:08,592
Malibu Club to Print Works — every dollar's by design

19
00:01:08,642 --> 00:01:11,203
Sonny brought the Forellis — left 'em laying on my floor

20
00:01:11,244 --> 00:01:13,623
You were Toreno's errand boy and Catalina's chore

21
00:01:13,673 --> 00:01:16,035
Stole a military jetpack, still got played like a pawn

22
00:01:16,085 --> 00:01:18,705
Let Ryder and Big Smoke fool your whole hood till dawn

23
00:01:18,755 --> 00:01:21,194
Check the calendar right now — the whole world's back in line

24
00:01:21,244 --> 00:01:23,952
GTA Six comes home to Vice — not your ninety-two shrine

25
00:01:25,693 --> 00:01:28,893
Yeah, Rockstar's back in Vice — and your name isn't on the list

26
00:01:28,943 --> 00:01:31,354
Jason and Lucia run your beach like you don't exist

27
00:01:31,389 --> 00:01:33,943
Ghosted after eighty-six — you vanished from the hall

28
00:01:33,993 --> 00:01:36,356
Left poor Ken in Vegas begging Tommy for a call

29
00:01:36,376 --> 00:01:38,921
Robbed Caligula's Casino, burned the crooked badges down

30
00:01:38,971 --> 00:01:41,464
Took the crown from Grove Street out to every rival town

31
00:01:41,514 --> 00:01:43,955
Twenty years of mods and memes — watch a legend replay

32
00:01:43,982 --> 00:01:51,150
Grove Street is home forever — remember the name, CJ

